From: Cargt <tim.carney@cargt.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add fdtfile definition for cargt-00395-02-00365.

The previous fdtfile patch was keyed off
MACHINE_FEATURES = "00395 00365", which both 00395-01-00365 and
00395-02-00365 share, so it couldn't tell the two boards apart and
both got the same hardcoded fdtfile=stm32mp257f-cargt-00395-00365v3.dtb
(a board that no longer exists). It was dropped without a replacement
actually present in this layer, leaving fdtfile completely unset -
U-Boot then has no default devicetree to load, requiring it to be set
by hand every boot.

Use a MACHINE-keyed SRC_URI:append instead (see the u-boot-stm32mp_%.bbappend
change) so each board gets its own correctly-named default. This is
the base devicetree with no LVDS panel variant selected; boards with a
specific panel attached can still override fdtfile to one of the
per-panel devicetrees (e.g. stm32mp257f-cargt-00395-02-00365-glt1011280800is1.dtb)
as needed.
---
diff --git a/include/configs/stm32mp25_st_common.h b/include/configs/stm32mp25_st_common.h
index ab5a4a91644..63887dfd6aa 100644
--- a/include/configs/stm32mp25_st_common.h
+++ b/include/configs/stm32mp25_st_common.h
@@ -10,7 +10,8 @@

 #define STM32MP_BOARD_EXTRA_ENV \
 	"usb_pgood_delay=2000\0" \
-	"console=ttySTM0\0"
+	"console=ttySTM0\0" \
+	"fdtfile=stm32mp257f-cargt-00395-02-00365.dtb\0"

 #include <configs/stm32mp25_common.h>
